{
  "meta": {
    "title": "NYC Climbing Gym Map",
    "description": "Indoor climbing gyms across NYC's five boroughs, styled as a transit map with three overlapping line systems: climbing discipline, gym company/brand, and training board type.",
    "lastVerified": "2026-07-16",
    "notes": "Each gym has two coordinate systems: `coords` (schematic x/y grid for the Vignelli-style abstracted map) and `coordsGeo` (real lat/lng for a literal, geographically-projected map \u2014 feed through d3.geoMercator() or geoAlbersUsa() for SVG placement). coordsGeo values are close approximations from public addresses (good to roughly block-level accuracy), not surveyed geocodes \u2014 run them through a geocoding API if you need higher precision."
  },
